1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,632
Every business moves through a loop of people,
decisions, and learning.

2
00:00:06,212 --> 00:00:10,964
A signal arrives from a customer, a market, or an
operational team.

3
00:00:11,544 --> 00:00:14,712
Someone turns it into a question worth answering.

4
00:00:15,292 --> 00:00:20,068
Others shape a plan, deliver a change, and
examine the outcome.

5
00:00:20,648 --> 00:00:24,200
What they learn becomes the starting point for
the next cycle.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,288
Now imagine a Duet beside every person in that
loop.

7
00:00:29,629 --> 00:00:35,341
In our fictional example, customers find the next
card activation step unclear.

8
00:00:35,682 --> 00:00:38,898
A researcher asks their Duet to review the
feedback.

9
00:00:39,238 --> 00:00:45,166
It organises evidence, asks focused questions,
and prepares a working summary.

10
00:00:45,507 --> 00:00:50,163
The researcher brings judgment. Duet brings help
that stays with the work.

11
00:00:50,504 --> 00:00:54,200
Each colleague has their own Duet, with their own
context.

12
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,672
The researcher shares the finding with the
business analysis team.

13
00:01:00,045 --> 00:01:04,317
Together, the analyst and their Duet turn it into
a clear user story.

14
00:01:04,689 --> 00:01:08,097
Make the next activation step easy to understand.

15
00:01:08,470 --> 00:01:13,558
They refine the scope, the customer journey, and
the acceptance criteria.

16
00:01:13,930 --> 00:01:18,538
The document evolves through conversation,
review, and correction.

17
00:01:18,911 --> 00:01:24,263
The business owner considers value, dependencies,
and available capacity.

18
00:01:24,635 --> 00:01:28,403
They decide what to take forward, and what to
leave for later.

19
00:01:28,776 --> 00:01:34,200
Duet keeps the decision, supporting material, and
next action connected.

20
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:38,832
Message Center makes that handoff explicit.

21
00:01:39,437 --> 00:01:43,973
The analyst's Duet publishes the agreed story to
the selected audience.

22
00:01:44,578 --> 00:01:49,882
One message carries its source, its files, and
its delivery status.

23
00:01:50,486 --> 00:01:54,086
The receiving Duets bring relevant updates to
their owners.

24
00:01:54,691 --> 00:01:59,491
Questions and feedback travel back, so the
conversation can continue.

25
00:02:00,096 --> 00:02:04,200
It connects information to people, and people to
the next step.

26
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:11,352
The Scrum Master's Duet brings the requirements
together and highlights dependencies.

27
00:02:11,732 --> 00:02:15,692
Through approved channels, it consults the
developers' Duets.

28
00:02:16,071 --> 00:02:19,911
Each person confirms the scope and commitments
that belong to them.

29
00:02:20,291 --> 00:02:24,755
Complex work can be delegated, with results
returned for review.

30
00:02:25,134 --> 00:02:29,982
Plans, files, and test evidence stay connected to
the task.

31
00:02:30,362 --> 00:02:34,826
People decide whether the outcome meets the
agreed acceptance criteria.

32
00:02:35,205 --> 00:02:41,109
Production integration is a future step, with
release decisions kept under human control.

33
00:02:41,489 --> 00:02:44,633
An update can then be published through Message
Center.

34
00:02:45,012 --> 00:02:50,148
Operational feedback returns to research: where
does uncertainty remain?

35
00:02:50,528 --> 00:02:54,200
The result of one cycle becomes the question for
the next.

36
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:58,448
Each cycle can deepen the partnership.

37
00:02:59,081 --> 00:03:04,673
Corrections, preferences, and project context
become reusable memory.

38
00:03:05,306 --> 00:03:09,650
Duet reviews experience and brings that knowledge
into future work.

39
00:03:10,283 --> 00:03:16,331
Imagine its share of suitable work growing from
ten, to fifty, to ninety-five percent.

40
00:03:16,965 --> 00:03:20,325
An illustrative ambition, not measured
performance.

41
00:03:20,958 --> 00:03:25,182
Progress depends on proven capability and
explicit authority.

42
00:03:25,815 --> 00:03:30,615
People keep key decisions; Duet takes on more
routine execution.

43
00:03:31,248 --> 00:03:34,200
Each cycle begins with greater understanding.

44
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:38,784
Across the organisation, people lead.

45
00:03:39,509 --> 00:03:42,461
Duets coordinate through approved connections.

46
00:03:43,186 --> 00:03:46,258
Message Center carries signals and outcomes.

47
00:03:46,982 --> 00:03:51,278
Every person, a Duet. Every handoff, a
connection.

48
00:03:52,003 --> 00:03:54,403
Every cycle, a better business.

49
00:03:55,128 --> 00:03:58,800
Duet. A human-led, AI-native organisation.
